            <p class="mt-6 md:mt-8 text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-slate-500 flex items-center gap-2 relative z-10">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 text-lg">🔒</span> 100% Free & Confidential. Chat instantly to share your reports.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-10 md:mt-16 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 md:gap-12 text-sm relative z-10">
              <div>
                <div class="font-black text-3xl md:text-4xl text-emerald-600">48 hr</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 mt-1">Priority Booking</div>
              </div>
              <div class="hidden sm:block h-12 w-px bg-slate-200"></div>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span>
                  <div>
                    <div class="font-bold text-base">4.98/5</div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Verified Patient Reviews</div>
                  </div>
