              <p class="mt-3 md:mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base">Share reports on WhatsApp. Get treatment plans and exact quotes quickly.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-violet-50 border border-violet-100 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500 to-purple-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 md:mb-8 shadow-inner">🏆</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">Elite Hospital Network</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 md:mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base">Direct priority access to Manipal Hospitals and top accredited centres.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 md:mb-8 shadow-inner">⏱️</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">Skip the Line</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 md:mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base">No waiting rooms. We arrange VIP appointments and direct admissions.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-amber-50 border border-amber-100 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-orange-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 md:mb-8 shadow-inner">✈️</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">Travel & Stay Arranged</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 md:mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base">Traveling to Bangalore? We arrange your local cabs, airport/station pickups, and partner hotel stays.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-rose-50 border border-rose-100 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-500 to-pink-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 md:mb-8 shadow-inner">🤖</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">24/7 Care Team</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 md:mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base">AI coordinator backed by real human care managers to guide your entire journey.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-400 to-cyan-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 md:mb-8 shadow-inner">🤝</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">Post-Surgery Support</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 md:mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base">We ensure a smooth discharge process and help schedule remote follow-up consults when you return home.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="partners" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-900 text-white">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-900 to-slate-900 rounded-[2rem] md:rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden relative">
            <div class="absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-[300px] md:w-[500px] h-[300px] md:h-[500px] bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2">
              <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 lg:p-20">
                <div class="uppercase text-emerald-400 font-bold tracking-[2px] md:tracking-[3px] text-xs md:text-sm">EXCLUSIVE PARTNER</div>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-4 md:mt-6 leading-tight md:leading-none">Manipal Hospitals</h2>
                <p class="mt-4 md:mt-8 text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300">Priority access, exact cost transparency, and seamless end-to-end coordination for our patients.</p>
                
                <div class="mt-8 md:mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-8 text-sm">
                  <div class="space-y-3 md:space-y-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Priority slots in 48 hrs</div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Direct hospital admission</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="space-y-3 md:space-y-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Transparent cost estimates</div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Dedicated care managers</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="relative min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[520px]">
                <img src="/VmJrama5RuC2UkdwRtPMgn7DStLjdCvzR2JKGBzr.avif" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" alt="Manipal">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t md:bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900/90 to-transparent"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="py-16 md:py-28 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end mb-10 md:mb-16">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-black tracking-[3px] md:tracking-[4px] text-violet-600">WORLD-CLASS SPECIALTIES</span>
              <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-2 md:mt-3">Centers of Excellence</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="text-sm md:text-base font-medium flex items-center gap-2 mt-4 md:mt-0 text-slate-500">
              Select your specialty to consult <span class="text-lg md:text-xl">👇</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6">
            <a href={whatsappLink} class="block bg-white border hover:border-amber-300 group rounded-2xl md:rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 text-center transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl cursor-pointer">
